                <head>396. Telegram 1243 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d396-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1955-12-02">December 2, 1955, 5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d396-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d396-1"/>
                <p>1243. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Re para 9 Mytel 1241 there follows Chinese text in Matthews numbers of
                    substantive portion second para beginning with “are determined” and all last
                    para Wang’s draft:</p>
                <p>5187 5788 1697 2735 6439 4419 7477 3191 6638 3730 2115 - 5303 - 6078 - 4893 - 626
                    - 1697 - 6439 - 4419 - 3953 - 3738 - 935 - 835 - 6213 - 365 - 6541 - 1756 - 5379
                    - 5494 - 1362 - 7051 - 2641 - 2402 - 7195 - 3920 - 3953 - 3738 - 5943 - 5770 -
                    7477 - 3191 - 452 - 2865 - 2345 - 6078 - 2744 - 1217 - 5821 - 2684 - 265 - 3016
                    - 3709 - 6615 - 7729 - 7043 - 6213 - 811 - 5821 - 3381 - 2754 - 6213 - 6527 -
                    1120.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
